      "start_char": 2028,
      "end_char": 2214,
      "text": "balance) will be about neutral in 2023. Excises (including fuel) 1/ 1.8 0.8 1.4\nCompared to the authorities estimated\n2022 outturn, expenditure in 2023 is GFS Expenditure 26.8 28.0 28.2\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "S00012",
      "start_char": 2214,
      "end_char": 2452,
      "text": "increased by 8.5 percent in nominal Interest payments 3.8 4.7 4.6\nterms (or by 0.1 percentage points of Fuel subsidy 1/ 0.0 0.5 0.0\nauthorities’ projected GDP). This increase\naccommodates higher spending of Overall balance -3.5 -3.8 -4.1\n"
    },
    {
