      "start_char": 2452,
      "end_char": 2656,
      "text": "interest payments, some social Primary balance -0.1 0.7 0.3\nSource: IMF staff calculations.\nprograms—particularly (non-\n1/ Fuel excises within excises include the revenue effects of using the excise rate\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "S00014",
      "start_char": 2656,
