    },
    {
      "segment_id": "S00015",
      "start_char": 2805,
      "end_char": 3022,
      "text": "projects. In addition, the allotted funding for social programs related to fertilizers, procurement of national\nmilk, and rural supplies has also been increased, though the size of the programs remains modest. On the\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "S00016",
